<title>USA: Audio King September same-store sales off.</title>
<headline>Audio King September same-store sales off.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audio King Corp said Thursday comparable-store sales in September declined six percent from the same year-ago period.</p>
<p>Total sales fell four percent to $5.8 million from $6 million a year ago.</p>
<p>The September year-to-date comparable-store sales were up three percent. Total sales increased five percent to $16.2 million from $15.3 million.</p>
<p>Audio King operates 11 consumer electronics specialty stores.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
